# 行尾：仓库内按 LF 存储，任何平台 checkout 也用 LF
# 项目里已有 .prettierrc（endOfLine 未显式指定，默认 lf），这里与之对齐，
# 避免 Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 时 git 反复报 "LF will be replaced by CRLF"。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 文本类需要显式声明，保证 diff 可读、可合并
*.js text
*.css text
*.html text
*.json text
*.md text
*.svg text
*.yml text
*.yaml text

# 二进制：不做行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
